  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Water and Energy for Food is a Grand Challenge supportin innovations and early stage business to develop professionalize and get access to finance. The innovations focus on the nexus water/energy/food and market segment is the world&apos;s poor with an objective to imporve livelihood through innovations that improve food production.</narrative>
  </description>
